e, excluding Dinosaur) may be requested by the Raccoon at the ",["l","大树桩（地点）","Giant Stump"]," as part of his third request, or as part of any request starting with the sixth."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.0","1.0"],": Introduced."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.1","1.1"],": Removed ability to make into ",["l","蛋黄酱","Mayonnaise"],", added ",["l","虚空蛋黄酱","Void Mayonnaise"],". Now also sold by ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],". Increased value from 50g to 65g."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Removed from ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," stock. Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"],". Can be requested in a Fish Pond quest. Can be produced by Fish Ponds."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Can be used for a ",["l","任务#List of Special Orders","Special Order"]," and the Home Cook's Bundle."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Can be used for a Raccoon request."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6.2","1.6.2"],": Is now poisonous instead of nutritious."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","虚空鸡","Void Chicken"]," • ",["l","陨石#The Witch","Witch"]," • ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]," • ",["l","虚空鲑鱼","Void Salmon"]," ",["l","鱼塘","Fish Ponds"]]],["Sell Price",["65g"]]]}